{"posts":[{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1052","t":"EU long from daily support:","a":"AERO","d":"","r":"","n":"#1052","p":43,"im":["e07f0c2c8cd28824ffa769eb9525f70554e6dc55"],"fa":"خرید EU از حمایت روزانه:","ib":{"e07f0c2c8cd28824ffa769eb9525f70554e6dc55":1},"m":1052},{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1053","t":"","a":"AERO","d":"","r":"","n":"#1053","p":43,"im":["c8850ed0547ff9322bc7314d385c34974d37c567","5062293ae245f1605af8c6e0facf26c46e5a5f94"],"ib":{"c8850ed0547ff9322bc7314d385c34974d37c567":0,"5062293ae245f1605af8c6e0facf26c46e5a5f94":0},"m":1053},{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1055","t":"","a":"DharmaTrader","d":"","r":"","n":"#1055","p":43,"im":["7d7723a924c482bd596af00d7ffba6897be17996","8447c122c00f1d43c2467ed4791c65996f7a421c"],"ib":{"7d7723a924c482bd596af00d7ffba6897be17996":0,"8447c122c00f1d43c2467ed4791c65996f7a421c":0},"m":1055},{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1057","t":"first Picture is DBR\n\nand if we look further left we can see it actually bottomed out of another base before that. see Picture #2 where u have RBR\n\nEdit: come to think of it Again. if u mean basing as in base on base. then its supply on top of another supply etc.","a":"Lehmann","d":"","r":"","n":"#1057","p":43,"im":["18b0a03abbabd9738a13f7a4050290dad0c1b648","08933a6770f58a65007fd460c238b6bd0fe1888a"],"fa":"تصویر اول DBR است.\n\nو اگر بیشتر به چپ نگاه کنیم می‌بینیم که در واقع پیش از آن از یک بیس دیگر هم بیرون آمده. تصویر #2 را ببین که RBR داری.\n\nویرایش: دوباره فکر می‌کنم. اگر منظور از basing همان base on base باشد، آن‌وقت supply روی supply دیگر است و غیره.","ib":{"18b0a03abbabd9738a13f7a4050290dad0c1b648":1,"08933a6770f58a65007fd460c238b6bd0fe1888a":3},"m":1057},{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1058","t":"Dappa wrote: Can someone explain the meaning of basing, that has always confused me. Is basing considered ranging? Isn't ranging considered a sort of equilibream state for price, meaning no imbalance.\n\nOr is basing the acumilation and distributing of orders, can someone explain? Would greatly appreciate it.\n\nHey Dappa,\n\ni have defined the base with black square (or box). To my understanding - price gets \"trapped\" between two important prices. (The high of the box and the low of the box.) The price has been given a limited range where it can move. (To understand why it limits the price - you should check engulfing, order-flow and flag limit articles.) Price needs a push from bigger money to break (engulf) the high or the low of the box (HTF can help you getting an idea in which way it will break.) Its indeed almost an equalibrium of price - from where a decision will be needed inin order to break bulish or bearish.\n\nOfcourse you have 100 pip and 5 pip ranges (bases) . In my case: It wasnt clear to me, and didnt wanna risk it - so i just closed the position.\n\n2 cents MIKY\n\np.s.: i havent mentioned some things - becouse they are mentioned in great RTM articles.","a":"AERO","d":"","r":"","n":"#1058","p":43,"im":["c8850ed0547ff9322bc7314d385c34974d37c567"],"fa":"Dappa نوشت: کسی می‌تونه معنی basing رو توضیح بده؟ همیشه گیجم کرده. آیا basing رو ranging می‌دونن؟ آیا ranging نوعی حالت تعادلی برای قیمت محسوب نمی‌شه، یعنی بدون عدم‌تعادل؟\n\nیا basing همون انباشت و توزیع سفارشاـه؟ کسی می‌تونه توضیح بده؟ خیلی ممنون می‌شم.\n\nسلام Dappa،\n\nبیس رو با مربع مشکی (یا باکس) تعریف کردم. به فهم من، قیمت بین دو قیمت مهم «گیرافتاده» می‌شه (سقف باکس و کف باکس). به قیمت یه رنج محدود داده شده که توش حرکت کنه. (برای فهم اینکه چرا قیمت رو محدود می‌کنه، مقاله‌های engulfing، order-flow و flag limit رو ببین.) قیمت برای شکستن (engulf) سقف یا کف باکس به یه هل از پول بزرگ‌تر نیاز داره (HTF می‌تونه کمکت کنه بفهمی به کدوم سمت می‌شکنه). واقعاً تقریباً تعادل قیمته - از جایی که برای شکست صعودی یا نزولی تصمیم لازمه.\n\nالبته رنج‌های 100 پیپی و 5 پیپی (بیس) داری. توی مورد من: برام روشن نبود و نمی‌خواستم ریسک کنم - پس فقط پوزیشن رو بستم.\n\n2 سنت MIKY\n\nپ.ن: بعضی چیزا رو نگفتم - چون تو مقاله‌های عالی RTM گفته شدن.","ib":{"c8850ed0547ff9322bc7314d385c34974d37c567":2},"m":1058},{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1062","t":"","a":"jogold24","d":"","r":"","n":"#1062","p":43,"im":["f78e91f241431cbe54bc436f2362315abe1cabb3","a1c274a06a9cc52254aac454157a898d1c8cbcd6"],"ib":{"f78e91f241431cbe54bc436f2362315abe1cabb3":0,"a1c274a06a9cc52254aac454157a898d1c8cbcd6":0},"m":1062},{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1065","t":"Banned","a":"Warren","d":"","r":"","n":"#1065","p":43,"im":["7972cffbcbcf546d8b76f8a37801ad88265541df"],"fa":"مسدودشده","ib":{"7972cffbcbcf546d8b76f8a37801ad88265541df":1},"m":1065},{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1067","t":"Chief Cook and Bottle Washer Contact Us","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","r":"Grand Master","n":"#1067","p":43,"im":[],"fa":"رئیس آشپزخانه و شیشه‌شور — تماس با ما","m":1067},{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1068","t":"","a":"djambazov84","d":"","r":"","n":"#1068","p":43,"im":["39b1817445334b953663a8c478a399abea28ff23"],"ib":{"39b1817445334b953663a8c478a399abea28ff23":0},"m":1068},{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1069","t":"","a":"djambazov84","d":"","r":"","n":"#1069","p":43,"im":["ba1d603a60f2c18f9b12437d1102b12e609c388b","6a312beb0f90958d45a25f12727db4851aeb2f76"],"ib":{"ba1d603a60f2c18f9b12437d1102b12e609c388b":0,"6a312beb0f90958d45a25f12727db4851aeb2f76":0},"m":1069},{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1070","t":"","a":"djambazov84","d":"","r":"","n":"#1070","p":43,"im":["26ceb9c8bc46e428b3e758df6d7fe01393b1fa42"],"ib":{"26ceb9c8bc46e428b3e758df6d7fe01393b1fa42":0},"m":1070},{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1071","t":"","a":"maknil","d":"","r":"","n":"#1071","p":43,"im":["0aead0ffd75b6c6664683a40ca64a4aeb472707f"],"ib":{"0aead0ffd75b6c6664683a40ca64a4aeb472707f":0},"m":1071},{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1072","t":"Chief Cook and Bottle Washer Contact Us FAQ","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","r":"Grand Master","n":"#1072","p":43,"im":["f91bb7e75943b77a4cf8a90c14a3a1d5b3cf0cdb"],"fa":"رئیس آشپزخانه و شیشه‌شور — تماس با ما — پرسش‌های متداول","ib":{"f91bb7e75943b77a4cf8a90c14a3a1d5b3cf0cdb":1},"m":1072},{"id":"supplydemand_p43_1073","t":"Banned","a":"Warren","d":"","r":"","n":"#1073","p":43,"im":[],"fa":"مسدودشده","m":1073},{"id":"